1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Why did no one tell me my
son was failing the year?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
I did tell her. Three times.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Both are telling the truth.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
But the warnings got lost along the way.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
A note in a backpack. A
message half-delivered.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
A meeting request nobody signed.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Each one was a warning
sign. None arrived in time.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Why not just a chat?

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Because in Guayaquil, a teacher's number
can end up in the hands of a gang.

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Teachers get threatened and
extorted for giving a fair grade.

11
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,000
So many no longer give out their number.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Meanwhile, a kid drifting away from class

13
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,000
gets closer to the
streets, and to the gangs.

14
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
No one should have to choose
between warning in time

15
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
and protecting their family.

16
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
That's why we built Cresco.

17
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,000
One: the teacher writes
it down the same day.

18
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:09,000
The family is notified instantly,
without naming the child.

19
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:14,000
And there's a record of who saw
it. The folder fills itself.

20
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Two: families take part,
and no one is anonymous.

21
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,000
They reply by name; the
teacher answers in writing.

22
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Three: the teacher never
gives out her number.

23
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,000
To talk, families book a meeting.

24
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:35,000
What keeps people safe is always free.
Premium appears when a family wants more.

25
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:39,000
The purchase goes through RevenueCat;
its webhook unlocks the plan.

26
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Teachers with several
classes get their own PRO.

27
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,000
I did tell her.

28
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,000
And I got there in time.

29
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:51,000
We're starting in Guayaquil.
Next: every classroom in Ecuador.

30
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Cresco: so no warning
sign arrives too late.
